1. Definitions

"Software" means the Family Tree Editor source code, documentation, assets,
and associated files distributed with this license.

"Layout Algorithm" means the family-tree layout logic implemented in
src/core/layout-engine.js, including its spouse grouping, sibling grouping,
generation packing, parent-child centering, iterative bottom-up and top-down
positioning, and related adaptations, but excluding independently licensed
third-party components such as Dagre and D3.

